A '''lava skiff''' was a [[repulsorlift]] vehicle used to hover above [[Magma|lava]] on the [[planet]] [[Mustafar]].<ref name="GaW">''[[Star Wars: A Galaxy at War]]''</ref>

==History==
In [[19 BBY]],<ref name="Date">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]''</ref> the [[Jedi]] [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] [[Duel on Mustafar|fought]] his former apprentice [[Anakin Skywalker|Darth Vader]] on the [[planet]] [[Mustafar]]. When the [[Klegger Corp Mining Facility|mining facility]] collapsed into the [[Magma|lava]] sea, Kenobi saved himself onto a lava skiff while Vader jumped on top of a [[DLC-13 mining droid]]. From there, Vader jumped on the skiff and continued to duel his former [[Jedi Master|master]]. As they reached land, Kenobi jumped off first and urged Vader to surrender. The [[Sith Lord]] angrily leaped towards Kenobi, who cut off Vaders [[Limb|legs]] and left him to burn next to the lava.<ref name="Ep3">{{Film|III}}</ref>

